@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Seed demo data (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/seed

### List tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### List actions exposed to the orchestrator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bot/actions

### Bot: create a ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "agent_alex",
  "sessionId": "agent-alex-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-agent-alex",
  "position": "support",
  "query": "Create a new ticket for Outlook not syncing email on Windows 11. Priority HIGH."
}

### Bot: assign a ticket (uses ticketNumber)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "agent_alex",
  "sessionId": "agent-alex-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-agent-alex",
  "position": "support",
  "query": "Assign ticket 1001 to agent_maya"
}

### Bot: escalate a ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "agent_alex",
  "sessionId": "agent-alex-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-agent-alex",
  "position": "support",
  "query": "Escalate ticket 1002 because the customer is blocked and the issue is impacting production."
}

### Bot: close a ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "agent_alex",
  "sessionId": "agent-alex-session",
  "conversationId": "chat-agent-alex",
  "position": "support",
  "query": "Close ticket 1003. Resolution: restarted the print spooler service and reinstalled the driver."
}

### Inspect a ticket by number
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1001
